                        <div><div><div class="lead-image"><img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/paragraphs/news/lead-images/Wake-Tech-News-Howard-Hughes-Scholars-lead.webp" width="1000" height="563" alt="A female student conducts scientific research." />
</div></div><div class="news-headline"><h3><a href="/post/wt-news-story/997537" hreflang="en">Wake Tech Selected for Undergraduate Science Scholars Program</a></h3></div><div class="views-field views-field-field-post-summary"><div class="field-content">Wake Tech has been selected as one of nine community colleges nationwide to participate in the new Howard Hughes Medical Institute Undergraduate Science Scholars Program, a pilot initiative designed to support talented students pursuing careers in the life sciences.<br />
<br />
</div></div><div class="views-field views-field-view-node"><span class="field-content">  <a href="/post/wt-news-story/997537" aria-label="Continue reading Wake Tech Selected for Undergraduate Science Scholars Program">
