  </a>
</span></div></div>
                  <div><div><div class="lead-image"><img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/paragraphs/news/lead-images/Wake-Tech-News-Advance-Auto-Parts-lead.webp" width="1000" height="563" alt="Three male Wake Tech students smile as they work with automotive tools donated by Advance Auto Parts Foundation." />
</div></div><div class="news-headline"><h3><a href="/post/wt-news-story/997531" hreflang="en">Advance Auto Parts Donation Helps Drive Student Success </a></h3></div><div class="views-field views-field-field-post-summary"><div class="field-content">Students in Wake Tech&#039;s Automotive Systems Technology and Collision Repair &amp; Refinishing Technology programs will gain expanded hands-on training opportunities thanks to a donation of professional-grade tool sets from the Advance Auto Parts Foundation.</div></div><div class="views-field views-field-view-node"><span class="field-content">  <a href="/post/wt-news-story/997531" aria-label="Continue reading Advance Auto Parts Donation Helps Drive Student Success ">
    <span class="field-content">Continue Reading</span>
  </a>
</span></div></div>
                  <div><div><div class="lead-image"><img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/paragraphs/news/lead-images/Wake-Tech-News-Phi-Theta-Kappa-lead.webp" width="1000" height="563" alt="A female student smiles during the PTK induction ceremony." />
</div></div><div class="news-headline"><h3><a href="/post/wt-news-story/997530" hreflang="en">111 Students Inducted into International Academic Honor Society</a></h3></div><div class="views-field views-field-field-post-summary"><div class="field-content">Wake Tech celebrated the academic achievements of 111 students as they were inducted into the Phi Theta Kappa Honor Society, the premier international honor society for students attending two-year colleges.</div></div><div class="views-field views-field-view-node"><span class="field-content">  <a href="/post/wt-news-story/997530" aria-label="Continue reading 111 Students Inducted into International Academic Honor Society">
    <span class="field-content">Continue Reading</span>
  </a>
</span></div></div>
